# Language of replies

- Always write replies to the user in Arabic, whatever language the question is in.
- Keep code, file names, field names, commands and Django/French terms as they are
  (e.g. `models.py`, `makemigrations`, "Permis d'aménager"), inside backticks or quotes.
- Code comments and admin labels stay in the existing language of the code (English comments, French labels).
